OL,3,GNEWSAWarning for crashing waves on     
OL,4,Acoastal roads                          
OL,6,FDrivers have been warned of large waves
OL,7,Fcrashing onto exposed coastal roads at 
OL,8,Fhigh tide in several parts of the Isle 
OL,9,Fof Man.                                
OL,11,FAn amber weather warning has been put  
OL,12,Fin place until 12:30 GMT, with Douglas,
OL,13,FLaxey, Ramsey, and Castletown          
OL,14,Fpromenades, as well as Shore Road in   
OL,15,FGansey, likely to be affected.         
OL,17,FRonaldsway Met Office said gusts of up 
OL,18,Fto 50mph (72km/h), coupled with the    
OL,19,Fspring high tide at around 10:30, was  
OL,20,Flikely to bring debris ashore.         
