OL,3,GNEWSAWarning for crashing waves on     
OL,4,Acoastal roads                          
OL,6,FA yellow warning for heavy rain is also
OL,7,Fin place until midnight, with up to    
OL,8,F1.2in (3cm) of rainfall expected to    
OL,9,Flead to some flooding due to the       
OL,10,Falready saturated ground.              
